{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Turquoise",
    "steam_appid": 3800420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/c0eefac9e376b743426cf1a3e1657987.avif?t=1755554827\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Turquoise, a 3D sandbox game that immerses you in the heart of a protected marine zone. In this peaceful space, you\u2019re free to imagine, decorate, and shape an environment that nurtures underwater life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.poster.avif?t=1755554827\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.webm?t=1755554827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.mp4?t=1755554827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/c078dbf3e1b1a248ebfb1059d8e85fd2.avif?t=1755554827\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the seabed using a freeform decoration editor place rocks, corals, plants, and objects to craft a harmonious environment. Every detail matters to attract and welcome new marine species, each more fascinating than the last. Collect, observe, and learn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.poster.avif?t=1755554827\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.webm?t=1755554827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.mp4?t=1755554827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you discover new fish and underwater creatures, you unlock entries in an integrated in-game wiki, where you can learn more about their behaviors, preferences, and origins. A peaceful, educational, and inspiring experience. Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f6bccf7f4f6291c86b468231f3eaf4f3.avif?t=1755554827\" width=616 height=154 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A freely modifiable 3D ocean zone,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive decoration editor,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection of fish and marine creatures,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated wiki to learn more about discovered fauna,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, contemplative atmosphere,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the wildlife thrive in the environment you created</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your slice of the ocean, watch it evolve, and let marine magic unfold.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/c0eefac9e376b743426cf1a3e1657987.avif?t=1755554827\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Turquoise, a 3D sandbox game that immerses you in the heart of a protected marine zone. In this peaceful space, you\u2019re free to imagine, decorate, and shape an environment that nurtures underwater life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.poster.avif?t=1755554827\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.webm?t=1755554827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.mp4?t=1755554827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/c078dbf3e1b1a248ebfb1059d8e85fd2.avif?t=1755554827\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the seabed using a freeform decoration editor place rocks, corals, plants, and objects to craft a harmonious environment. Every detail matters to attract and welcome new marine species, each more fascinating than the last. Collect, observe, and learn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.poster.avif?t=1755554827\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.webm?t=1755554827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.mp4?t=1755554827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you discover new fish and underwater creatures, you unlock entries in an integrated in-game wiki, where you can learn more about their behaviors, preferences, and origins. A peaceful, educational, and inspiring experience. Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f6bccf7f4f6291c86b468231f3eaf4f3.avif?t=1755554827\" width=616 height=154 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A freely modifiable 3D ocean zone,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive decoration editor,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection of fish and marine creatures,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated wiki to learn more about discovered fauna,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, contemplative atmosphere,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the wildlife thrive in the environment you created</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your slice of the ocean, watch it evolve, and let marine magic unfold.</p>",
    "short_description": "Turquoise is a relaxing 3D sandbox and collection game where you create and decorate a marine protected area to welcome a wide variety of fish and underwater creatures. Observe the wildlife thrive in the environment you created.",
